  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lot 1: Reconstruction of the regional road R 221 from Zubin Potok to the village Dren</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract foresees the improvement of municipal social and economic infrastructure in municipalities in the north of Kosovo through reconstruction of the Regional Road R 221, 8,7 km long and 6 m wide from Zubin Potok to the village Dren.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
